WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.730
Is everyone ready?

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.990
Wait up!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.330
Wilbell-san! Hurry!

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.680
Phew, I made it.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.830
Geez, what were you doing?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.790
Just a little something.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.110
We're all here now, so let's take off!

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.030
Wait for us, Flameu-chan!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.340
This is the Geosys.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.690
Do you remember this place, Clone?

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:48.750
Yes, but it aged quite a bit compared to how I remember it.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.990
It's different than last time.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.410
The machines are running!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.980
I suppose Flameu is trying to activate the Geosys.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.250
It's broken, isn't it?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.130
Too much time has passed.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.940
No matter how skilled of an alchemist you are,

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:19.070
no one can make something that lasts forever.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.260
Right now Flameu is the interface that's keeping it running.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.330
I feel very sorry for her.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.120
Flameu will probably attack us again.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.630
Please wait here.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.610
Understood.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:35.310
Yes.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.980
Okay, let's go.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.540
Don't get in my way.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.920
Flameu-chan!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.690
Don't talk to me.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.670
I'm trying to reinvigorate the land.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.450
That's not going to work.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.510
You won't be able to do that with this facility.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.970
Everybody disappeared.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:09.470
The sun has set, and it has become cold.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.510
The lush green land has turned brown.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.520
Where has everyone gone?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:21.280
Flameu-chan, you're just feeling sad since you realised you can't do anything by yourself!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.860
Am I feeling sad?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.280
I don't understand.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:30.030
Flameu-chan, we're trying to help you!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:34.140
We want to live with you, and work together to make this world better!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:38.800
If everyone works together, I'm sure we can make every day wonderful!

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:44.120
I made a promise; a very important promise.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.810
I'm still here because of that promise.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.780
Don't get in my way.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.060
I... I don't...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.190
Flameu-chan, listen to us!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.070
I don't need humans!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.410
Please, Kuu, lend me your power!

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.830
Exterminate the humans!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.670
It's coming!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.390
It's the same as last time!

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.800
I should be able to hold it off!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.920
Now! Everyone, attack!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:25.910
Okay!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:26.720
Here I go!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.930
Now!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.400
3, 2, 1!

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.290
It's working!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:49.320
At this rate...!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.000
You don't understand, do you?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.620
You won't stop me from fulfilling my promise.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.240
What is she doing?

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.570
It's dangerous. Everyone, watch out!

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:58.880
Clone-san, watch out!

00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.750
Clone?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.170
Something's coming!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.100
Clone-san!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.720
Clone!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.350
Flameu.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.670
Now let us await the end of dusk.

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.820
So I can fulfil my precious promise.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.250
I won't let you fulfil that kind of promise!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.990
Flameu, your research failed the moment you disregarded humans!

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:35.120
There must have been people who tried to help you!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:39.370
You just haven't realised how important that is!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.380
That's why you've been alone!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.230
Nobody can do anything by herself!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.340
Neither you, nor I!

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.720
Logy-san.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.300
I don't understand.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.640
I don't get it!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.840
Escha, stop her.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.860
Got it!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.770
I won't let anyone get in my way!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:13.620
A shield?

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:14.450
It's no use.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.140
Like hell it is!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.830
The shield is...!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:25.800
Amazing...

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.140
Thanks to that, I'm clear to attack!

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:38.020
Let my voice transcend the gap between the present and the past to deliver these words.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:42.900
Answer my call and appear before me, Wind Lord!

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:48.240
What?

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.410
I'm not done yet.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.410
Fire?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.320
Wilbell-san, don't tell me you...!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.540
Exactly!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:02.260
Pray follow our temporary contract, and heed my call this once.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:05.500
By your flames, incinerate everything, Fire Lord!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.150
She summoned the Fire Lord?

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.510
So that's why she was late!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.430
I shall keep my promise, young human.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:22.020
I shall engulf everything with my purifying flames!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.720
Why must you get in my way?

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.160
There's something I must do!

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:38.490
No!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:45.370
So you chose to not burn everything, young human.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:49.090
Well, since Escha has made her decision, it can't be helped.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.450
I've fulfilled my promise.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.720
Why did you save me?

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:01.720
That's because we are supposed to be friends.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.680
Friends?

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:07.310
Flameu-chan, I am Escha Malier.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.630
I'm an alchemist from Colseit.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.400
Escha Malier.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.150
Malier?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.470
Are you an alchemist too?

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:18.340
One of those humans that ran from me?

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:21.370
You're the one who ran away, Flameu.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.660
Clone!

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:27.040
Clone?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:45.140
You're the one who ran away, Flameu.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.370
I ran away?

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.570
I did it in order to fulfil my promise...

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:51.730
My promise?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.530
What was my promise?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.320
Have you forgotten?

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.910
It was your only wish.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.120
You're... Clone...

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.280
Clone?

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:04.910
I don't believe it.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.790
You left me for the humans.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:13.790
No. You left everyone, even me, behind and followed your own path alone.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.100
I see. That's what happened?

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.050
I can't believe it!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.110
Are you having a hard time remembering?

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.180
I think she is.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:30.660
When I was an interface, I forgot even my most precious memories.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:33.280
However, when the opportunity comes...

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.110
Flameu-chan.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.690
What is it? Someone's talking directly to my heart.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.800
I am Nio.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:45.900
I used to be the interface of a ruin.

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.970
Nio? Can you hear my voice?

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:50.110
Yes.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.290
Flameu-chan, try to remember.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.460
Remember the promise deep within your memories.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.090
The one you've been trying to protect.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:01.040
My memories... my promise...

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:07.940
That's right. I gave up relying on humans,

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.640
but Clone was different.

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.480
Have your memories returned?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:16.640
The Geosys alone cannot save the land.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.860
We must work together with humans.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.370
But I flew into the sky by myself.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:28.600
Yes, you left me behind as well as our companions.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:34.390
Even so, you left us an apple tree seedling.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:35.870
I did? To you?

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:36.890
Yes.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:42.270
I planted a small apple tree with the people left on the ground.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:48.270
It grew, and over time turned into a large orchard.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:51.770
I can no longer harvest it by just myself.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.100
That's right.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:57.100
I gave you an apple tree. The ones that never give up regardless of how harsh it is.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.270
I wonder why...?

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.950
Why did I do that?

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.920
Wasn't it because you made a promise?

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:05.480
A really important one.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:09.910
However, even if you don't fulfil that promise, it's okay.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.720
Clone?

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.540
That's right.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.910
I made a really important promise with Clone.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.170
Flameu.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.760
While you were growing apples,

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.130
I wanted to figure out why the land turned barren.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:30.750
While you water the fields, I will find out why this is happening.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.760
Once I know, I will come back to you,

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.910
and we will eat the delicious apples together.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:58.040
However, you had already lost faith in humans at that point, hadn't you?

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:08.720
You didn't once come back to us.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:15.470
Yeah... I promised that I would come back and eat the delicious apples with you.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.310
I'm back, Clone!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.730
I'm back now!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.640
Welcome back, Flameu.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.480
Thank you so much for your hard work.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:24.990
I'm sorry.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.940
I was supposed to find out why the land turned barren,

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:30.040
but I couldn't fulfil our promise!

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.700
But I've always wanted to see you!

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.290
Me too.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.110
I wanted to see you.

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:43.460
Even though I should have come to see you, it took me a long time.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.300
I am really sorry.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.390
Thanks, Clone.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:57.350
Flameu-chan?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.350
Flameu-chan's...!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.610
Flameu...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.890
Since Flameu was the ruins' interface, that means...

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:12.990
It's shaking!

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:14.080
This is bad!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:14.950
Everyone, run!

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:36.380
Escha!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.020
Logy, get on the airship!

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.540
Escha, jump!

00:14:58.700 --> 00:14:59.840
Escha!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.450
Yes!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:09.960
They did it!

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.270
Flameu-chan is...

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.420
Flameu had chosen to bind herself to the Geosys.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:32.360
She can travel between Geosys and should have transferred to another ruin elsewhere.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:37.050
I've seen ruins like this one.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:41.590
And I can feel she's somewhere out there.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.080
Flameu-chan...

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:08.230
There are plants growing out of the ruins' debris.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.550
Is this also part of the Geosys' power?

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:11.650
Probably.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.860
There are other ruins where plants grow in the surrounding area.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.620
Did Flameu-chan's research bear fruit?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.120
No.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.410
This only happened because the plants
absorbed the nutrients in the ruins' surroundings.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.340
It will cause the surrounding area to die even faster.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:28.380
If she wanted to reinvigorate the Earth, you could say she has failed.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:33.760
Hey! Hey!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.130
Wilbell-san! Nio-san!

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.720
The harvest's about to start!

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.200
That's right...!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.940
That's okay. You can go.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.390
Hey, is that...?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.390
Is that Flameu-chan?!

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:25.680
The first Geosys used to be around here long ago.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:28.610
I came here because I wanted to talk with all of you even if just once.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.150
How about you, Clone?

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.860
We already talked a lot.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.950
So much that I'm starting to feel tired.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:39.400
So that tiny seedling turned into such a great apple tree.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.660
This land was so barren that nothing could've grown on it.

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:46.000
It took a lot of work, Flameu,

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.800
but the humans didn't give up.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.090
It's hard to believe.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.420
Humans are so hard to understand.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:57.580
We fight, and our opinions can be very different.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:03.110
But still, everyone is working their best to make this world better.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:07.390
Even if we choose the wrong path, somebody will come along and correct it.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.360
That's how we've always been.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.730
I see.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.820
I guess that's right.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.750
Take these.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.410
What are they?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.560
New life.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:24.660
I am sure they will one day bloom into wonderful flowers.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.620
Thanks, Flameu-chan.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.590
An apple...

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.230
We grew it here.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:34.960
It's delicious.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.770
Thanks, Escha Malier.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:46.930
Flameu.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.740
Flameu, come back.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:53.400
Flameu, please!

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:55.860
Flameu, let's do this together!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.030
Flameu!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.530
"The Hummingbird Princess who was alone,

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:06.830
is no longer alone."

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:12.180
"And just like that, everyone made the watering can together,

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:15.210
and the flowers bloomed across town."

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.900
"And everyone lived happily ever after."

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.920
Thanks, everyone!

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.340
Congratulations, Escha-chan!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.020
Now, Logy-kun.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.900
Yes.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.820
Logix Fiscario,

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.660
the Central Technology Bureau has extended an invitation for you...

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:59.170
...to be a technology advisor at a new research centre.

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.820
Congratulations, Logy-kun.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:21.240
I've been looking for you, Escha.

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:22.040
Logy-san.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:25.010
We can't see the ruins anymore.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:28.650
Yes, but my dream came true.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.390
It's all thanks to you.

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.970
I didn't do anything...

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:45.610
Um...

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.490
I...

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.950
I decided to go back to Central City.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:57.290
Yes... congratulations, Logy-san.

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:05.010
Everyone, thanks for having me.

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:08.970
Logy-san... um...

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.060
Be safe.

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:11.930
Yeah, you too, Escha.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:14.890
Taking off!

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:23.770
Logy-san!

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:25.230
Escha...

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:29.320
I will become a great alchemist!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:33.430
I will become an awesome alchemist that can make just about anything!

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:35.200
That's why...

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:37.160
Please do your best too!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:38.420
Escha!

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:54.550
My oh my. Escha, all stories continue on.

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:55.990
Clone?

00:22:55.990 --> 00:22:58.940
Escha, I plan on writing picture books again.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:01.110
Really?

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:02.690
What kind of story do you want to tell?

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:03.850
Let's see.

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:07.520
This time, I want to write something that will never end. I want it to go on forever.

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:10.660
I want to write a happy story that everyone can be excited about.

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:16.710
Let's call it... that's right...

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:19.580
